  "name": "Motor Carrier Delivery Trailer Manifest",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Motor Carrier Delivery Trailer Manifest Transaction Set (212) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment.\nThis transaction set can be used to allow motor carriers to provide consignees or other interested parties with the contents of a trailer, containing multiple shipments, that has been tendered for delivery. It is not to be used to provide the recipient with data relative to a full truckload shipment.",
